    },
    {
      "id": "9l1hwv8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Establishment of RBI"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Reserve Bank of India was established on April 1, 1935, following the recommendations of the Hilton Young Commission.",
        "Nationalised on January 1, 1949, RBI serves as the central bank regulating India's financial system.",
        "Maintains price stability while ensuring growth through quantitative and qualitative monetary policy tools.",
        "Sole authority in India responsible for issuing currency notes (except one-rupee notes and coins).",
        "Acts as a banker to both the Central and State Governments as well as commercial banks."
      ],
      "id": "h9m8mf7"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "aso8h4i",
      "content": "• RBI was established on 1 April 1935."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "u6ftnip",
      "content": "• It was established under the Reserve Bank of India Act, 1934."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "llgyury",
      "content": "• The headquarters of RBI is located in Mumbai."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "iyytvcf",
      "content": "• It was nationalized in 1949."
    },
    {
      "id": "jxjp698",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. Objectives of RBI"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mf9q4ik",
      "content": "• To regulate the issue of banknotes."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nx3pn5o",
      "content": "• To maintain monetary stability in the country."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "53nb985",
      "content": "• To operate the currency and credit system."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nwuzdf5",
      "content": "• To support economic growth."
    },
    {
      "id": "62ba8se",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. Functions of RBI"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Reserve Bank of India (RBI)",
      "id": "07kmksz"
    },
    {
      "id": "eakrr0k",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
